# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NeMo Guardrails — Colang rules for Mortgage RAG Chatbot
#
# This file defines what the bot SHOULD answer (mortgage/banking/finance)
# and what it SHOULD refuse (everything else).
#
# The LLM checks every user message against these flows before the main
# RAG pipeline runs. If a refusal flow matches, the user gets a polite
# redirect instead of a hallucinated answer.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────


# ── GREETINGS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

define user express greeting
  "hi"
  "hello"
  "hey"
  "good morning"
  "good afternoon"
  "good evening"
  "howdy"
  "greetings"
  "what's up"
  "yo"
  "namaste"

define bot express greeting
  "Hello! I'm your Mortgage Document Assistant. I can help you find information from your mortgage documents — loan terms, interest rates, fees, compliance requirements, and more. What would you like to know?"

define flow greeting
  user express greeting
  bot express greeting


# ── MORTGAGE / HOME LOAN QUESTIONS ──────────────────────────────────────────

define user ask mortgage question
  // Loan types and products
  "What is a home loan?"
  "What is a mortgage?"
  "What is a home equity loan?"
  "What is a HELOC?"
  "What is a reverse mortgage?"
  "What is a construction loan?"
  "What is a jumbo loan?"
  "What is a conforming loan?"
  "What is an FHA loan?"
  "What is a VA loan?"
  "What is a USDA loan?"
  "What is a fixed-rate mortgage?"
  "What is an adjustable-rate mortgage?"
  "What is a hybrid ARM?"
  "What is a balloon mortgage?"

  // Interest rates
  "What is the interest rate?"
  "What is the fixed rate?"
  "What is the adjustable rate?"
  "What is the APR?"
  "What is the rate lock?"
  "What is the rate cap?"
  "How does the interest rate change?"
  "What is the rate forecast?"
  "What is the rate outlook?"
  "What is the rate environment?"
  "What is the rate cycle?"
  "What is the rate movement?"
  "What is the rate direction?"
  "What is the rate change impact?"
  "What is the rate hike impact?"
  "What is the rate cut impact?"
  "What is the base rate?"
  "What is the MCLR?"
  "What is the EBLR?"
  "What is the repo rate impact?"
  "What is the spread over prime rate?"

  // Loan terms and amounts
  "What are the loan terms?"
  "What is the loan amount?"
  "What is the loan tenure?"
  "What is the loan term?"
  "How much can I borrow?"
  "What is the maximum loan amount?"
  "What is the minimum loan amount?"
  "What is the LTV ratio?"
  "What is the loan-to-value ratio?"
  "What is the combined LTV?"
  "What is the CLTV?"

  // EMI and payments
  "What is the EMI?"
  "What is the EMI breakdown?"
  "What is the principal amount?"
  "What is the interest component?"
  "What is the total interest payable?"
  "What is the amortization schedule?"
  "What is the amortization?"
  "What is the payment schedule?"
  "When is the EMI due?"
  "What is the grace period?"
  "What is the moratorium period?"

  // Fees and charges
  "What is the processing fee?"
  "What is the late fee?"
  "What is the prepayment penalty?"
  "What is the foreclosure charge?"
  "What are the closing costs?"
  "What is the origination fee?"
  "What is the underwriting fee?"
  "What is the appraisal fee?"
  "What is the title insurance?"
  "What is the recording fee?"
  "What is the transfer tax?"
  "What is the stamp duty?"
  "What is the registration fee?"
  "What is the legal fee?"
  "What is the broker fee?"
  "What are the hidden charges?"
  "What is the documentation charge?"
  "What is the inspection fee?"

  // Eligibility and qualification
  "What is the eligibility criteria?"
  "What documents are required?"
  "What is the credit score requirement?"
  "What is the CIBIL score?"
  "What is the minimum CIBIL score?"
  "What is the income proof required?"
  "What is the debt-to-income ratio?"
  "What is the DTI ratio?"
  "What is the FICO score?"
  "What is the down payment?"
  "What is the minimum down payment?"
  "What is the deposit requirement?"
  "What is the margin money?"
  "What is the co-applicant?"
  "What is the guarantor?"

  // Property
  "What is the property valuation?"
  "What is the property type requirements?"
  "What is the property appraisal?"
  "What is the property inspection?"
  "What is the title search?"
  "What is the title deed?"
  "What is the encumbrance certificate?"
  "What is the occupancy requirement?"
  "What is the owner-occupied property?"
  "What is the investment property?"

  // Insurance and protection
  "What is the mortgage insurance?"
  "What is the PMI?"
  "What is the home loan insurance?"
  "What is the credit insurance?"
  "What is the life cover for home loan?"
  "What is the property insurance?"
  "What is the home insurance?"
  "What is the flood insurance?"
  "What is the title insurance?"

  // Tax benefits
  "What is the home loan tax benefit?"
  "What is the Section 24 benefit?"
  "What is the Section 80C benefit?"
  "What is the Section 80EE benefit?"
  "What is the principal deduction?"
  "What is the interest deduction?"
  "What is the capital gains tax?"
  "What is the stamp duty deduction?"

  // Refinancing and balance transfer
  "What is the refinancing option?"
  "What is the refinance?"
  "What is the balance transfer?"
  "What is the top-up loan?"
  "What is the loan takeover?"
  "What is the loan restructuring?"
  "What is the loan modification?"
  "What is the loan settlement?"
  "What is the foreclosure?"
  "What is the prepayment?"
  "What is the part payment?"

  // Schemes and subsidies
  "What is the PMAY scheme?"
  "What is the PMAY subsidy?"
  "What is the CLSS?"
  "What is the MIG?"
  "What is the LIG?"
  "What is the EWS?"
  "What is the housing for all?"
  "What is the credit linked subsidy?"

  // Legal and regulatory
  "What is the SARFAESI Act?"
  "What is the RERA?"
  "What is the RTI?"
  "What is the RBI regulation on home loans?"
  "What is the LTV regulation?"
  "What is the foreclosure regulation?"
  "What is the prepayment regulation?"
  "What is the grievance redressal?"
  "What is the ombudsman scheme?"

  // NPA and default
  "What is the NPA?"
  "What is the non-performing asset?"
  "What is the classification of NPA?"
  "What is the SMA?"
  "What is the special mention account?"
  "What is the write-off?"
  "What is the recovery process?"
  "What is the auction process?"
  "What is the debt recovery tribunal?"

  // Banking ratios and financial metrics
  "What is the cost-to-income ratio?"
  "What is the capital adequacy ratio?"
  "What is the CET1 ratio?"
  "What is the CRAR?"
  "What is the LCR?"
  "What is the NSFR?"
  "What is the provisioning coverage ratio?"
  "What is the net interest margin?"
  "What is the NIM?"
  "What is the return on equity?"
  "What is the ROE?"
  "What is the return on assets?"
  "What is the ROA?"
  "What is the earnings per share?"
  "What is the EPS?"
  "What is the dividend?"
  "What is the dividend payout ratio?"
  "What is the CASA ratio?"
  "What is the loan-to-deposit ratio?"
  "What is the P/E ratio?"
  "What is the price-to-book ratio?"

  // Bank financial statements
  "What are the total assets?"
  "What is the balance sheet?"
  "What is the income statement?"
  "What is the profit and loss?"
  "What is the net profit?"
  "What is the net interest income?"
  "What is the non-interest income?"
  "What is the fee income?"
  "What is the operating expenses?"
  "What is the provision for credit losses?"
  "What is the gross advances?"
  "What is the net advances?"
  "What is the total deposits?"
  "What is the wholesale banking?"
  "What is the retail banking?"
  "What is the treasury operation?"
  "What is the asset quality?"
  "What is the credit rating?"
  "What is the solvency ratio?"
  "What is the liquidity ratio?"

  // Comparison questions
  "How does this bank compare to competitors?"
  "Which bank has lower interest rates?"
  "What is the difference between fixed and floating rate?"
  "How does this loan compare to other products?"
  "Which is better — FHA or conventional?"
  "What is the difference between HELOC and home equity loan?"
  "How does the CET1 ratio compare to last year?"
  "Did the NPA ratio improve or worsen?"
  "Which segment contributed the most revenue?"

  // Inferential questions
  "Why did the profit increase?"
  "What caused the NPA to rise?"
  "What factors led to the provision reduction?"
  "What trend can be inferred from the data?"
  "What does the green bond issuance indicate?"
  "How is the bank positioned for growth?"
  "What risk does the fine exposure highlight?"
  "What external factors affected the results?"

  // Document and report questions
  "What does the annual report say?"
  "What is in the balance sheet?"
  "What does the auditor's report say?"
  "What are the key audit matters?"
  "What is the accounting framework?"
  "What accounting standards are used?"
  "What is the reporting period?"
  "What is the fiscal year?"
  "Who audited the financial statements?"
  "What is the auditor's opinion?"
  "What are the notes to accounts?"
  "What is in the schedule?"
  "What is the segment reporting?"
  "What is the related party transaction?"

  // KYC and compliance
  "What is KYC?"
  "What is the KYC policy?"
  "What are the customer identification procedures?"
  "What is the CIP?"
  "What are the OVDs?"
  "What is beneficial ownership?"
  "What is enhanced due diligence?"
  "What is PEP screening?"
  "What is the AML policy?"
  "What is the suspicious transaction reporting?"

define bot answer mortgage question
  "I can help you with that. Based on the documents provided, I'll find the relevant information for you."

define flow handle_mortgage_question
  user ask mortgage question
  bot answer mortgage question


